WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Introduction to photosynthesis.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:12.000
Photosynthesis is the process by which plants convert light energy into chemical energy.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:18.000
The key equation is: six CO2 plus six H2O, with light, yields glucose and six O2.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:24.000
Chlorophyll is the primary pigment that absorbs light in the chloroplasts.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:30.000
There are two main stages: the light-dependent reactions and the Calvin cycle.
